  3. validate          run the start test
       where: proposed (no deterministic location)

── validation before proceeding ──
  - start the workload
      expected: it starts
  - Investigate the v1.0.0 → v1.1.3 upgrade against this environment (this investigation covered only the proposed target)
      expected: Every change of the new transition is classified, with no new hard finding.

── backout ──
  Restore $.spec.source.targetRevision in apps/acme.yaml line 12 to v1.0.0 (the value before the upgrade), then revert any configuration step of this change in reverse order.
  model: revert the pin last

